          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "two isolated CAN buses (CAN0, CAN1), each driven by its own MCP2515 SPI CAN controller (U8, U9)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The SPI data lines are swapped on both CAN controllers. If the CM4 GPIO directions follow the net names, the controller's MISO line drives the MCP2515 SI input and the controller's MOSI line conflicts with the MCP2515 SO output, preventing SPI communication and making the CAN0/CAN1 motor-control interfaces nonfunctional.",
